  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "KCl is more ionic than NaCl while NaCl is more ionic than LiCl\r\nAlso, more the ionic nature, more is the conductivity thus, order of equivalent conductance at infinite dilution is $\\mathrm{KCl}>\\mathrm{NaCl}>\\mathrm{LiCl}$",
